BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261201-21@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261125T113414Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261201T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261201T210000
SUMMARY:The Public Theater's PUBLIC FORUM: 14th with Ava DuVernay
LOCATION:Town Hall\, Midtown-Times Square
DESCRIPTION:Ava DuVernay's acclaimed new film 14th explores the birth\, leg
 
acy\, and monumental importance of the 14th Amendment - the way that its gu
 
arantees of citizenship rights and due process have helped America to take 
 
enormous strides in the direction of its founding ideals. Inspired by DuVer
 
nay's film\, and in collaboration with DuVernay herself\, Public Forum will
 
 present a special one-night event bringing the world of the 14th Amendment
 
 to life. Featuring historical texts and songs\, clips from the film\, and 
 
a conversation with DuVernay\, featuring Alicia Keys and more\, the evening
 
 will connect the fraught days of Reconstruction to the challenges of our o
 
wn time. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/the-public-theaters-p
 
ublic-forum-14th-new-york-new-york-12-01-2026/event/0300655DFEBA2D91
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/the-public-theaters-public-forum-14th-new-
 
york-new-york-12-01-2026/event/0300655DFEBA2D91
END:VEVENT
