SUMMARY:Joe Lovano: Streams of Expression
LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Joe Lovano: Streams of Expression featuring Steve Slagle\, Ralp
 
h Lalama\, George Garzone\, Gary Smulyan (saxes)\, Glenn Drewes\, Barry Rie
 
